WEBVTT

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:07.150
Cosmic Era 72.

00:00:07.150 --> 00:00:15.490
The 18 month war between the Earth and the PLANTs finally came to an end at the battle of Jachin Due.

00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:23.250
The two sides agreed to a truce amidst the ruins of Junius Seven, a testimony of tragedy unprecedented.

00:00:23.250 --> 00:00:26.710
The treaty outlined the intentions of both parties to gain a better understanding of each other,

00:00:26.710 --> 00:00:28.090
and promised every effort to maintain peace.

00:00:28.090 --> 00:00:31.510
As such, the world was on a path back to harmony.

00:00:32.220 --> 00:00:35.640
Why is this necessary in the first place?! Why now?!

00:00:37.050 --> 00:00:40.520
We made a pledge not to repeat the tragedies of the past!

00:00:41.060 --> 00:00:43.500
We were committed to following a path that we could proceed along hand in hand!

00:00:43.500 --> 00:00:46.270
More of that idealistic crap the Athhas are so famous for!

00:00:46.540 --> 00:00:47.310
Shinn!

00:00:52.490 --> 00:00:54.320
We've caught up with Bogey One.

00:00:54.780 --> 00:00:57.280
Orange 55, Mark 90, Alpha.

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.200
We're going to crush them!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:02.960
All hands to battle stations! Pilots are to proceed to the briefing room!

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:13.620
Bogey One...

00:01:14.300 --> 00:01:19.220
I wonder what that ship's real name is.

00:01:19.220 --> 00:01:21.680
<i>Gunner ZAKU Warrior, catapult engaged.</i>

00:01:22.380 --> 00:01:25.180
Lunamaria Hawke! ZAKU! I'm taking off!

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:33.320
<i>You're next, Impulse. Go ahead!</i>

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:38.160
Shinn Asuka! Core Splendor! Taking off!

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.140
The name of a thing is an indicator of its existence.

00:02:05.100 --> 00:02:08.850
Then what if that name is not real?

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:13.610
If it isn't real, would that mean its existence isn't real either?

00:02:14.110 --> 00:02:15.980
Is that what it would mean?

00:02:17.060 --> 00:02:19.070
Alex... Or rather...

00:02:19.660 --> 00:02:21.030
Athrun Zala.

